    "claudeRule": "When a journey action for a screen is audited, update cccLevelsCompleted. When all journey actions for a screen are result=PASS, set screen status=CERT-PASS only if: (a) no knownIssue has regressionGuardStatus != PASS, (b) all sixGuarantees for all journeys using this screen are signed."
